  "visibleTextNormalized": "HomeAbout usPolicies and reportsNSW public school information NSW public school information This page includes updates and messages from the NSW Department of Education. It brings together content that applies to families of all NSW public schools. Understanding school policies Want to know how things like behaviour, attendance or mobile phone use are handled in NSW public schools? Our school follows policies set by the NSW Department of Education. These policies guide our school practices to provide a safe, fair and supportive environment for every student and help families understand what to expect from us. To learn more, visit the department's Policy library today. Policy Library Have a question? We’re here to help with information for all NSW public school families. Reach out for more information. Contact us Our policies and reports Discover our local school policies, reports and plans. east Our principal and staff Get to know our principal and staff, who work together to create a positive school culture. east Section navigation About us Enrol Facilities and resources HSC Results Our principal and staff Policies and reports NSW public school information School history and archives Stories and highlights Transition to high school Why choose us?",
